    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***THREE BED SEMI FOR SALE WITH NO ONWARD CHAIN LOCATED IN THE POPULAR CARRIGMORE ESTATE***\n\nByrne Malone Estate Agents are delighted to present 16 Carrigmore Meadows to the market. A superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home located in the highly sought-after Carrigmore development in Saggart, Dublin 24. Nestled at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains, this property offers a perfect blend of suburban tranquillity and urban convenience, ideal for modern family living.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and well-proportioned, comprising a welcoming entrance hallway, spacious living room, and a contemporary kitchen/dining area with access to a private rear garden?perfect for relaxing or entertaining. Upstairs features three generous bedrooms, including a master with en-suite, along with a stylish family bathroom.\n\nThe location is second to none, with Citywest Shopping Centre just a short stroll away, offering a wide range of shops, cafés, and essential services. Excellent transport links are nearby, including the LUAS Red Line at Saggart and Citywest Campus, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre. Residents also benefit from close proximity to the charming villages of Saggart and\nRathcoole, both offering a variety of schools, restaurants, bars, and local amenities. With easy access to the N7 and M50 road networks and surrounded by scenic outdoor spaces, this property represents an ideal opportunity for families and commuters alike.\n\nTo view this exceptional home please call us on 01 912 5500"
      },
